92
00:04:48,980 --> 00:04:51,130
- Just try it. - Okay.

93
00:04:53,340 --> 00:04:54,710
What's it supposed to...

94
00:04:54,710 --> 00:04:56,590
Oh, my God, that's so freaky!

95
00:05:00,960 --> 00:05:02,780
You're a mean one

96
00:05:02,780 --> 00:05:04,100
Mr. Grinch.

97
00:05:04,800 --> 00:05:06,800
Okay. Me, me, me. Ready?

98
00:05:09,100 --> 00:05:10,800
Leonard, I am your father.

99
00:05:13,470 --> 00:05:15,290
I have never been more attracted to a woman

100
00:05:15,290 --> 00:05:17,090
who sounds like a man in my life.

101
00:05:22,930 --> 00:05:25,320
Hey... you know how we've been...

102
00:05:25,320 --> 00:05:27,190
taking things slow?

103
00:05:28,140 --> 00:05:29,680
Well, I've been thinking, and...

104
00:05:29,680 --> 00:05:31,670
maybe I'm ready to...

105
00:05:31,670 --> 00:05:34,400
take things a little... faster.

106
00:05:35,530 --> 00:05:36,380
Oh, great.

107
00:05:37,110 --> 00:05:38,670
And I promise, after waiting four months,

108
00:05:38,670 --> 00:05:40,420
fast is what you're gonna get.

109
00:05:43,930 --> 00:05:45,070
You know, just-just one thing.

110
00:05:45,070 --> 00:05:46,470
Look, we're in a really great place right now,

111
00:05:46,470 --> 00:05:47,700
and I don't want to do anything

112
00:05:47,700 --> 00:05:49,470
that will make stuff all weird again.

113
00:05:49,470 --> 00:05:51,280
So we won't let it get weird.

114
00:05:51,280 --> 00:05:53,000
Okay. Oh, and just a heads-up...

115
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:54,910
mm, since the last time you saw me naked,

116
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:56,700
I got a Cookie Monster tattoo.

117
00:05:57,020 --> 00:05:58,570
The acceptable response"s when you see it

118
00:05:58,570 --> 00:06:00,170
are "awesome" or nothing.

119
00:06:01,180 --> 00:06:02,330
What about...

120
00:06:03,830 --> 00:06:05,890
Cookies!

121
00:06:11,440 --> 00:06:12,340
Amy?

122
00:06:12,690 --> 00:06:13,590
Amy?

123
00:06:13,700 --> 00:06:14,840
Amy?

124
00:06:17,040 --> 00:06:18,970
7:00, right on time.

125
00:06:18,970 --> 00:06:20,670
It's not an accident.

126
00:06:21,720 --> 00:06:23,930
I waited outside your door for 20 minutes.

127
00:06:24,810 --> 00:06:26,380
Well, dinner's almost ready.

128
00:06:26,670 --> 00:06:27,630
I must say,

129
00:06:27,630 --> 00:06:28,940
I was surprised you chose to spend

130
00:06:28,940 --> 00:06:30,700
