131
00:06:30,700 --> 00:06:31,880
As I mentioned,

132
00:06:31,880 --> 00:06:35,890
the Pasadena City Council is debating longer crosswalk times,

133
00:06:36,590 --> 00:06:39,670
and later, the LEGO store is having a midnight madness sale.

134
00:06:40,390 --> 00:06:42,230
You ask anyone, that's a hot date.

135
00:06:43,030 --> 00:06:45,450
Tempting choices, but I have something special

136
00:06:45,450 --> 00:06:46,670
planned for tonight.

137
00:06:46,670 --> 00:06:48,010
What can be more special than

138
00:06:48,010 --> 00:06:50,670
having an adequate amount of time to cross the street

139
00:06:50,670 --> 00:06:53,910
